   extension of C99ModularReference, 2026-10-21, exact B1.03 r2/div
   precedent). The hand-built statement C99ModularReference.rxCode is
   checked here against the pinned source parse; this equality is its
   source binding in the KeygenMkgm3Callees form. rx_transcription closes
   the content parity with the job-558 KeygenModpRx record (whose
   rx_source_bound/rx_header remain byte-stable). No Montgomery law,
   value law or totality for modp_Rx is claimed here. -/
namespace FT1536.Source3.KeygenRxCallees

theorem rx_source_bound :
    C99ModularParser.region 2609 18=some C99ModularReference.rxCode := by decide

theorem rx_transcription : C99ModularReference.rxCode = KeygenModpRx.rxCode := by decide

